  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/A1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Fixture: `use Tesla` -> only `imports file -> Tesla:module (use_directive)`; Caller.go -> MyApi:get carries no external_owner_ancestors; `use HTTPoison.Base` -> implements edge + ancestors ['HTTPoison.Base'] but io-boundaries still external_potential for both (elixir-web-and-db.yaml:92-93 rows only request/request!). USE_IMPLIED_BEHAVIOURS (elixir.py:271-286) has no Tesla; no USE_INJECTS table. MECHANISM: the module-level `use` relationship is derived only from a behaviour table. elixir.py unchanged on this path since filing. ROOT-CAUSE GROUPS: analyzer has no arm for the construct (with INV-zopiz, WI-kavam, WI-zihuf); framework-inherited owner unrowed (with WI-fivor, WI-tafum). Status unchanged."  # e3dc
